ty as polls showed him trailing.","helps":"R","kind":"ad","src":"https://cronkitenews.azpbs.org/2026/10/01/andy-biggs-katie-hobbs-arizona-polls-kalshi/"},{"title":"Hobbs declines to debate","date":"2026-07-31","what":"Hobbs's campaign said town halls beat a stage built for soundbites, and Biggs's team said she was ducking a tradition dating to 1954.","helps":"R","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.azfamily.com/2026/07/31/gov-katie-hobbs-declines-debating-andy-biggs-governors-race/"}],"events":[{"title":"Debate or skip","prompt":"The Clean Elections Commission is holding the only governor's debate, and the incumbent skipped a debate in 2022 too. What does the campaign do?","issue":"other","src":"https://www.azfamily.com/2026/07/31/gov-katie-hobbs-declines-debating-andy-biggs-governors-race/","opts":[{"label":"Town halls instead","say":"Skip the stage and hold open town halls and press events across the state.","pos":0.0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Show up","say":"Take part in the debate and dare the opponent to join.","pos":0.0,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Empty chair attack","say":"Debate and run ads hitting the opponent for hiding from voters.","pos":0.0,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Phase out income tax","prompt":"A plan to phase out Arizona's income tax and DOGE the state budget is on the table while Medicaid funding is under scrutiny. Where does the campaign stand?","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.fox10phoenix.com/election/2026-election-debate-arizona-gubernatorial-candidates-face-off","opts":[{"label":"Protect services","say":"Oppose the tax phase out and protect Medicaid, schools and child care.","pos":-0.7,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Targeted relief","say":"Offer targeted credits for families while keeping the budget balanced.","pos":0.1,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"DOGE Arizona","say":"Eliminate the income tax and root out waste and fraud in state programs.","pos":0.9,"trump":0.9,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"